---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lang = 'zh';
---
<PageLayout title="联系我们" description="提交原料采购与项目评估需求" lang={lang} heroTitle="联系我们" heroSubtitle="提交原料采购与项目评估需求">
  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
    <div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-5">先说明您的需求</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">请提供原料名称、用途、目标市场、数量及所需文件，以便评估需求。报价、样品、供货与交期均须另行确认。</p>
      <a href="mailto:info@zlbotanicals.com" class="text-primary font-semibold underline break-all">info@zlbotanicals.com</a>
      <p class="mt-6 text-gray-600">您也可直接发送邮件；若表单报错或未获回复，请使用同一邮箱跟进。请勿发送敏感个人信息或保密配方。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-off-white rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-5">在线咨询</h2>
      <p id="form-disclosure" class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">此表单通过第三方 FormSubmit 处理并转发至邮箱，提交信息将离开本网站。邮件投递及收件邮箱激活状态尚未验证；请勿仅依赖表单处理紧急事项。</p>
      <p class="text-sm mb-6"><a href="/zh/privacy" class="text-primary underline">网站隐私说明</a> · <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" class="text-primary underline">FormSubmit 隐私政策（外部）</a></p>
      <form action="https://formsubmit.co/info@zlbotanicals.com" method="POST" aria-describedby="form-disclosure" class="space-y-5">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="ZL Botanicals — ingredient inquiry" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://zlbotanicals.com/zh/thank-you" />
        <div><label for="contact-company" class="block font-medium mb-2">公司（选填）</label><input id="contact-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-primary" /></div>
<div><label for="contact-name" class="block font-medium mb-2">姓名（必填）</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-primary" /></div>
<div><label for="contact-email" class="block font-medium mb-2">邮箱（必填）</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-primary" /></div>
<div><label for="contact-market" class="block font-medium mb-2">目标市场（选填）</label><input id="contact-market" name="market" type="text" class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-primary" /></div>
        <div><label for="contact-message" class="block font-medium mb-2">需求说明（必填）</label>
          <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="6" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus-visible:outline-primary"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg">通过 FormSubmit 发送咨询</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</PageLayout>
